  "dcterms:identifier": "ActorDefinition/TrustDemo.Role.NationalPortal",
  "schema:name": "NationalPortal",
  "dcterms:title": "National health portal",
  "dcterms:description": "The home country's portal that issues each family member's records (IPS, DVCs) as a passcode-protected Verifiable Health Link and hosts the manifests (J4.0), checking the passcode, expiry and consent on each request and logging every access at home (J4.1): the VHL Sharer.\n\n**Persona**: A government service signing with the national DSC, issued under the national CSCA and already shared with the GDHCN; hosts manifests and encrypted documents for a limited time.\n\n**Also known as**: VHL Sharer (IHE ITI VHL); Issuer of the family's VHLs (SMART Trust Issuer)\n\n**Played in the journeys by** (fictional):\n\n- Lao PDR national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXH)\n\n**In the user scenarios**:\n\n- [J4.0 — Crossing back: one family, one phone](scenarios.html#j40--crossing-back-one-family-one-phone-lao-pdr-12-months-later): J4.0b Dad creates a link to share at the clinic\n- [J4.1 — Crossing back: a Thai doctor sees the full history](scenarios.html#j41--crossing-back-a-thai-doctor-sees-the-full-history-chiang-rai-12-months-later): J4.1 A Thai doctor sees the full history\n\n**On the device screens**: [S7 VHL QR Display & Passcode Protection (Bounmy's phone)](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/demo/S7/); [S8 Foreign Clinic VHL Viewer & Audit Trace (Dr. Anan's tablet)](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/demo/S8/)\n\n**Discussed in the workshop modules**: [M5 Governance, decision rights and the legal basis](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/m5/); [M6 Doing it once, together](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/m6/); [M7 Our first move, what it costs, and what we ask for](en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/m7/)\n\n**Lanes and tasks in the business processes**:\n\n- [J4.0 Issue the family's records to one phone as VHLs](business-processes.html#j40-issue-the-familys-records-to-one-phone-as-vhls): Assemble each member's IPS and DVCs; Encrypt, publish a passcode manifest; Prepare the HCERT carrying the VHL at key 5; Finish the HC1 QR text\n- [J4.1 Read a family member's records at the point of care abroad](business-processes.html#j41-read-a-family-members-records-at-the-point-of-care-abroad): Check passcode, log access, return manifest\n\n**Decisions it makes**:\n\n- Decision table [TD.DT.05 Does the portal release the manifest for this request?](decision-logic.html#tddt05-does-the-portal-release-the-manifest-for-this-request), in: Check passcode, log access, return manifest\n\n**Data sets its tasks record or read**: [TD.J40 Shared link and consent](dictionary.html#tdj40-shared-link-and-consent); [TD.J41 Access to a shared link](dictionary.html#tdj41-access-to-a-shared-link)\n\n**Indicators that count its decisions**: [TD.IND.02 Shared-link openings that were authorised](indicators.html#tdind02-shared-link-openings-that-were-authorised)",
  "schema:version": "0.1.0",
